              visible: DIV2,
              highlighted: ["A","D","BC","EF"] },
            { text: "Therefore the unit {A} measures the number {D} the same number of times that {BC} measures {EF}.",
              visible: DIV2,
              highlighted: ["A","D","BC","EF"],
              justifications: [{ ref: "VII.Def.20" }] },
            { text: "Therefore, if a unit number measures any number, and another number measures any other number the same number of times,",
              visible: DIV2,
              highlighted: ["A","BC","D","EF"] },
            { text: "then alternately, the unit measures the third number the same number of times that the second measures the fourth.",
